  "privacySec1Title": "1. Commitment to Privacy",
  "privacySec1Content": "At Twinfix, we are dedicated to protecting your personal data and respect your privacy. This Privacy Policy details how we collect, store, process, and protect your information when you utilize our image cleaning and optimization services.",
  "privacySec2Title": "2. Information We Collect",
  "privacySec2Content": "We process image metadata, photo metrics, and files directly on your local device to perform face blurring, watermark removal, duplicate detection, and metadata deletion. Local analysis ensures your original photos are never uploaded to any remote servers without your explicit consent.",
  "privacySec3Title": "3. Data Storage & Transfer",
  "privacySec3Content": "All optimization tools, duplicate scanning algorithms, and processing layers run natively on your smartphone. We do not store or transmit any image content to external cloud storage. When user profiles sync with Supabase, only metadata (like streak count, cleaning badges, and general stats) is synchronized securely.",
  "privacySec4Title": "4. Information Security",
  "privacySec4Content": "We prioritize the safety of your information. We apply robust device-level cryptographic practices and industry-leading transport security protocol (HTTPS/TLS) for account interactions and statistics sync. No third parties can access your processed files.",
  "privacySec5Title": "5. Contact Us",
  "privacySec5Content": "If you have any questions or feedback regarding this Privacy Policy or data handling practices in Twinfix, please contact us through the official support website or in-app feedback channel.",
  "termsSec1Title": "1. Acceptance of Terms",
  "termsSec1Content": "By accessing or using Twinfix, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you should immediately cease using the application.",
  "termsSec2Title": "2. Description of Service",
  "termsSec2Content": "Twinfix offers device storage optimization features, including local duplicate image detection, metadata removal, face/watermark blurring, and performance statistics tracking. We provide these services \"as-is\" and reserve the right to modify or discontinue features at any time.",
  "termsSec3Title": "3. User Accounts & Subscriptions",
  "termsSec3Content": "Certain premium services in Twinfix require active subscriptions or in-app purchases. You are responsible for safeguarding your credentials and payment methods. Subscription processing is securely handled by official store systems (Apple App Store / Google Play).",
  "termsSec4Title": "4. Permissible Usage",
  "termsSec4Content": "You agree to use Twinfix only for lawful purposes. You must not attempt to reverse-engineer, exploit, hack, or disrupt the operation of the application, local database architectures, or backend synchronization systems.",
  "termsSec5Title": "5. Limitation of Liability",
  "termsSec5Content": "Twinfix runs photo deletion and cleanup commands directly under user direction. We are not liable for any accidental loss of image files, data corruption, or hardware errors resulting from your configuration or device storage constraints. Please verify any photo deletion selection carefully."
